      <details class="faq-item" open>
        <summary>What does the custom home process look like?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__body"><p>Three stages: a design consultation to set a buildable plan, pre-construction covering permitting, budget and scheduling, and construction with regular updates through <strong>one point of contact</strong>.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What styles of homes do you build?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__body"><p>Any style, from modern homes with extensive glazing to traditional New England designs, including detailed work like custom millwork, stone flooring, floating stairs and board-formed concrete.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What do you need from me to start?</summary>
        <div class="faq-item__body"><p>Where you plan to build, whether you have a site, and where you are in the design process. Site conditions, approvals and drawings shape the scope before we set a price or start date.</p></div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
